[0.0, "o", "hat_repository.dart#L227-L237\u0007ChatRepository.resolveDefaultWorkingDirectory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n  \u001b[1m## 2. Bugs & Functional Issues\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2.1. A2UI Surface Actions & Outbound RPC Messages Are Not Forwarded in the Live App\u001b[m\r\n\n  In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2b81b4717a289955;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L20-L28\u0007ChatViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, both \u001b[94mforwardSurfaceActionsToAgent\u001b[m and \u001b[94mforwardRpcMessagesToAgent\u001b[m default to \u001b[94mfalse\u001b[m:\n\n\u001b[97D\u001b[38;5;70;1mthis\u001b[38;5;252;22m.forwardSurfaceActionsToAgent = \u001b[38;5;70;1mfalse\u001b[38;5;252;22m,\u001b[m\n\u001b[42D\u001b[38;5;70;1mthis\u001b[38;5;252;22m.forwardRpcMessagesToAgent = \u001b[38;5;70;1mfalse\u001b[38;5;252;22m,\u001b[m\r\n\n  Because \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk779a654d5c3efc27;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/main.dart#L22\u0007MarkdownChatApp\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 instantiates \u001b[94mChatViewModel()\u001b[m with default parameters, clicking interactive submit buttons\r\n  on \u001b[94mA2uiSurface\u001b[m cards or executing agent-initiated \u001b[94mcallRender"]
[0.0, "o", "erFunction\u001b[m calls in the live desktop app only appends\r\n  to \u001b[94m_threadActions\u001b[m / \u001b[94m_threadOutboundRpcMessages\u001b[m without sending the response turn back to the Antigravity agent\r\n  (tests call \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2bcc29cac4e8d797;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L687\u0007sendSurfaceAction\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk73377e5e7d9f35e3;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L730\u0007sendRpcMessageToAgent\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 manually).\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2.2. Stream Self-Cancellation When Handling Outbound RPC Calls\u001b[m\r\n\n  When \u001b[94mforwardRpcMessagesToAgent\u001b[m is enabled (or when multiple RPC responses are sent),\r\n  [\u001b[94m_handleOutboundRpcMessage\u001b[m](file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model\r\n  .dart#L21\r\n\u28df  \u001b[94mLoad\u001b[90ming...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
