[0.0, "o", "[m cancels the in-flight assistant\r\n  stream before any trailing Markdown or subsequent chunks arrive.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mMulti-RPC collision\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke29aefd177e73a70;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L1105-L1130\u0007ChatRepository.buildWorkspaceRpcReply\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, two \u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m messages\r\n  (\u001b[94mgetWorkspaceInfo\u001b[m and \u001b[94mlistWorkspaceFiles\u001b[m) are emitted in the same block. Calling \u001b[94msendRpcMessageToAgent\u001b[m for the\r\n  second immediately cancels the stream subscription started for the first.\r\n\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mRecommendation\u001b[m: Queue outbound \u001b[94mRendererToAgentMessage\u001b[m items generated during a stream turn and flush them as a\r\n  single batched \u001b[94mRendererToAgentMessagePayload([...])\u001b[m after the current stream completes (\u001b[94monDone\u001b[m).\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2.3. Renaming a Thread Destroys Its Active Agent Session History\u001b[m\r\n\n  In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9460e947b165da2d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_"]
