[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AWhen \u001b[94mforwardRpcMessagesToAgent\u001b[m is enabled (or when multiple RPC responses are sent), \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkdc05b24b7f4fb665;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L217-L230\u0007_handleOutboundRpcMessage\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  synchronously invokes \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2d96c40781b2d27a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L730-L766\u0007sendRpcMessageToAgent\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u2192 \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9547b35360ce45da;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L788-L795\u0007_streamAssistantTurn\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, which immediately cancels\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94m_replySubscriptions[threadId]\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mMid-stream cancellation\u001b[m: \u001b[94mStreamedAnswer.feed(chunk)\u001b[m processes \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>\u001b[m blocks while the assistant's stream is\r\n  still open. Firing \u001b[94msendRpcMessageToAgent\u001b[m synchronously inside \u001b[94moutboundListener\u001b[m cancels the in-flight assistant\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[4Cream before any trailing M"]
[0.0, "o", "arkdown or subsequent chunks arrive.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mMulti-RPC collision\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6a8a06931d2d4da7;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L1105-L1130\u0007ChatRepository.buildWorkspaceRpcReply\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, two \u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m messages\r\n  (\u001b[94mgetWorkspaceInfo\u001b[m and \u001b[94mlistWorkspaceFiles\u001b[m) are emitted in the same block. Calling \u001b[94msendRpcMessageToAgent\u001b[m for the\r\n  second immediately cancels the stream subscription started for the first.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mRecommendation\u001b[m: Queue outbound \u001b[94mRendererToAgentMessage\u001b[m items generated during a stream turn and flush them as a\r\n  single batched \u001b[94mRendererToAgentMessagePayload([...])\u001b[m after the current stream completes (\u001b[94monDone\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### 2.3. Renaming a Thread Destroys Its Active Agent Session History\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk30192cc102791b1c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L515-L531\u0007ChatViewModel.renameThread\u001b"]
[0.001, "o", "[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk65377977dff19901;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L509-L525\u0007ChatRepository.getOrCreateSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[94m_sessionMetadata\u001b[m includes \u001b[94mthreadTitle\u001b[m. Whenever a thread is renamed, \u001b[94mcloseThreadSession(threadId)\u001b[m is called (and\r\n  \u001b[94mexistingMeta == desiredMeta\u001b[m becomes \u001b[94mfalse\u001b[m), which calls \u001b[94mexistingSession.stop()\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 Stopping the \u001b[94mAgent\u001b[m session terminates the \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m conversation context for that thread, so the next message\r\n  in that thread starts a brand-new agent session with no memory of prior messages in the thread.\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 Additionally, in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7e7d41adcc1d3bdb;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L658\u0007ChatViewModel.sendMessage\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mfinal shouldAutoTitle = !current.isAutoTitled || current.messages.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94misEmpty;\u001b[m will overwrite a user-supplied title if the user renamed an "]
