[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[26A\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9733039466e972f6;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L293-L331\u0007ChatRepository.findOutsideWorkspacePathInCommand\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd55afcec3cc482a4;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L175-L192\u0007ListWorkspaceFilesFunction.execute\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\t\t\t \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke116fc109b965c8d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/project_dialog.dart#L189-L194\u0007ProjectDialog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\n\u001b[36D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke66f03050d8b06ba;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L98-L116\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[60Cntent`\r\n\u287f \n\n\n\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.05, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A\u001b[1m### 3.1. Command Path Parsing False Positives & Bypass Vectors\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7346d31fd386a5ff;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L293-L331\u0007ChatRepository.findOutsideWorkspacePathInCommand\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 tokenizes \u001b[94mcommandLine\u001b[m via \u001b[94mRegExp(r'''[\\s\"'\u001b[m;|&><()]+''')` and\r\n  checks prefixes:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mFalse Positives\u001b[m: Non-path arguments starting with \u001b[94m/\u001b[m after quote stripping\u2014such as \u001b[94mawk '/pattern/' file.txt\u001b[m or \u001b[94msed\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m's/foo/bar/'\u001b[m\u2014are treated as absolute paths (\u001b[94m/pattern/\u001b[m) outside the workspace and trigger sandbox-escape prompts.\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mFalse Negatives\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      \u2022 Flags with \u001b[94m=\u001b[m assignments such as \u001b[94mcurl --output=/etc/foo\u001b[m or \u001b[94mgit --git-dir=/tmp/repo status\u001b[m start with \u001b[94m--\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6Cbypassing the \u001b[94mtoken.startsWith('/')\u001b[m check.\u001b[K\n\u001b[42D\u2022 Environment variable expansions like \u001b[94m$HOME/.ssh\u001b[m or \u001b[94m${TMPDIR}/script.sh\u001b[m do not start with \u001b"]
[0.0, "o", "[94m~\u001b[m or \u001b[94m/\u001b[m.\r\n\tRelative parent traversal at the end of a path without a trailing slash (e.g., \u001b[94mfoo/..\u001b[m when not preceded by \u001b[94m..\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m/\u001b[m) is missed by \u001b[94mtoken == '..' || token.startsWith('../') || token.contains('/../')\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\n  \u001b[1m### 3.2. Synchronous Directory Listing on the UI Isolate\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk17b49e827992acd1;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L175-L192\u0007ListWorkspaceFilesFunction.execute\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 runs \u001b[94mdir.existsSync()\u001b[m and \u001b[94mdir.listSync(followLinks: false)\u001b[m synchronously on the\r\n  main UI thread, collecting and sorting all entries before applying \u001b[94m.take(limit)\u001b[m. If the workspace is a large\u001b[K\r\n  directory (e.g., \u001b[94m$HOME\u001b[m, which is a one-click preset in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd37d340b2541d8d8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/project_dialog.dart#L189-L194\u0007ProjectDialog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), \u001b[94mlistSync()\u001b[m can stall UI rendering.\u001b[K\r\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b"]
[0.0, "o", "[K\r\n  \u001b[1m## 4. UI / UX & Code Quality Observations\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mMessage Feed Scroll Behavior\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1671972e2a8709b;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L98-L116\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 uses a \u001b[94mListView.builder\u001b[m without a \u001b[94mScrollController\u001b[m. As tokens stream\r\n  into a long Markdown or A2UI message, the viewport does not automatically scroll to keep the latest content in view.\r\n  \u2022 **Duplicate `\u001b[K\n\b\b\b\u001b[90m.\u001b[94m.\u001b[m\n\n\n\u001b[14D\u001b[?2026l"]
